<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="holy-paladin-phase-4-bis">Holy Paladin - Phase 4 BiS</h4>This is the best possible setup in Phase 4 and thus Cataclysm Classic in general, with two important caveats. First, remember your choice of boot enchant depends on your talent choices, as discussed in the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-talent-builds-glyphs-pve">Talent Build Guide</a>. Second, though the trinkets selected do sim as the highest healing output, it is highly debated if they are actually the best options for in-game content. See the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/paladin/holy/healer-bis-gear-pve#jewelry">Jewelry</a> section below for a more detailed ranking of trinkets for this phase.  <br/>
