<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="obsidian-fragments-valor-points">
<span class="c2">Obsidian Fragments &amp; Valor Points for Holy Paladin Healer in Phase 4</span></h3>With Phase 4, Cataclysm Classic has a new dungeon difficulty added: Protocol Twilight. Completing these instances will reward you with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
